  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="142fc2cf-12dd-5fc3-9b53-88ad3d8a3768" activityNameId="ac25866e-74d4-5757-a14b-3078177dc22d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Capacitor, film, through-hole mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Capacitor, film, through-hole mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical film type capacitor for hole-through mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such capacitors and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of capacitors with a weight of 0.7 gram/unit. In 2023, only production efforts data are updated, which are explained in separate modules. Furthermore, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; UUID: 4c358092-eae3-323b-9a62-3a164e7130bf
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used film capacitors for hole-through mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of film type capacitors.
Technology: average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4c358092-eae3-323b-9a62-3a164e7130bf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of film type capacitors.</text>
